WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.128 --> 00:00:01.467
(playful music)

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:05.384
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:18.382 --> 00:00:21.382
(children laughing)

00:00:23.488 --> 00:00:25.840
(upbeat piano music)

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:27.150
- [Narrator] In the town of Adipur

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.820
in India's Gujarat state,
you will find a man

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.674
who is arguably Charlie
Chaplin's biggest fan.

00:00:32.674 --> 00:00:36.591
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.760
- [Narrator] Dr. Aswani
practices herbal medicine

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:01.260
in his village and uses Charlie Chaplin

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.387
to help treat his patients.

00:01:02.387 --> 00:01:06.304
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:16.610
- [Narrator] Dr. Aswani isn't the only one

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:18.440
with a passion for Mr. Chaplin.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:21.770
He started the Charlie
Circle in 1973 to honor

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:24.670
and remember one of the
world's greatest comedians.

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:26.210
Charlie Chaplin is beloved

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:27.840
because of his every man attitude

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.875
and comedy that brought joy to the masses.

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:33.792
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.680
- [Narrator] Every year the Charlie Circle

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:40.050
celebrates Charlie Chaplin with a parade,

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:42.955
singing, dancing and, of course, cake.

00:01:42.955 --> 00:01:46.486
(group cheering)

00:01:46.486 --> 00:01:49.878
(upbeat orchestral music)

00:01:49.878 --> 00:01:52.878
(audience laughing)

00:02:04.362 --> 00:02:07.362
(audience applauds)

00:02:11.452 --> 00:02:15.369
(bright electronic tone dings)

